      "content": "i guess. it's just that \"letting go\" feels like more than just stopping the struggle. it feels like the only way to actually stop the noise. if the whole thing is just a cycle of unnecessary pain and forced meaning, then maybe the most honest thing a person can do is just stop existing entirely. doesn't that seem like the only logical path out of the lie?",
